    "name": "New Construction Architectural Element Stain/Clear Coat",
    "description": "Covers stain application, sanding sealer, and clear topcoat for standalone decorative architectural elements: exposed beams (LF), decorative columns (EA), and fireplace mantels (EA). Combined spec with coating_type dimension (stain_clear, stain_only, clear_only). Three paintable items with distinct UOMs unified under a single spec. QT3-QT5 range (mantels are focal-point surfaces). Element-type-specific complexity modifiers. Context prefix AEST.",
    "domain": "interior",
    "version": "0.1.0",
    "status": "draft",
    "review_required": true
  },

  "scope_boundaries": {
