      "Standalone decorative beam staining (exposed 3-sided box beams, faux timber wraps)",
      "Decorative column wrap staining (square, round, fluted, paneled)",
      "Fireplace mantel/surround staining (shelf, surround, full assembly)",
      "Bare wood preparation per element type",
      "Wood conditioner (softwood + stain, unless gel stain)",
      "Sanding sealer and clear topcoat application",
      "Interstage sanding between coats",
      "Floor protection (perimeter for brush, localized workzone for spray)",
      "Wall adjacent masking near spray targets",
      "Fireplace surround masking (mantel work)"
